{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2021-04-08 09:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'AbbVie Submits Regulatory Applications for SKYRIZI® (risankizumab) in Psoriatic Arthritis to FDA and EMA', 'text': 'NORTH CHICAGO, ILL., APRIL 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBVIE\xa0(NYSE: ABBV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SUBMITTED APPLICATIONS SEEKING APPROVAL FOR SKYRIZI® (RISANKIZUMAB-RZAA, 150 MG) TO THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) AND FOR SKYRIZI® (RISANKIZUMAB, 150 MG) TO THE EUROPEAN MEDICINES AGENCY (EMA)\xa0FOR THE TREATMENT OF ADULTS WITH ACTIVE PSORIATIC ARTHRITIS.1\xa0THE SUBMISSIONS WERE SUPPORTED BY TWO PIVOTAL PHASE 3 STUDIES, KEEPSAKE-1 AND KEEPSAKE-2, WHICH EVALUATED SKYRIZI IN ADULTS WITH ACTIVE PSORIATIC ARTHRITIS INCLUDING THOSE WHO HAD RESPONDED INADEQUATELY OR WERE INTOLERANT TO BIOLOGIC THERAPY AND/OR NON-BIOLOGIC DISEASE-MODIFYING ANTI-RHEUMATIC DRUGS (DMARDS).1 "MOST PATIENTS LIVING WITH PSORIATIC ARTHRITIS EXPERIENCE BOTH SKIN AND JOINT DISEASE WHICH CAN BE ESPECIALLY BURDENSOME.'}{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2021-04-08 08:09:00-04:56', 'title': 'Accenture Acquires Core Compete, Expands Capabilities and Talent in AI-powered Supply Chain, Cloud and Data Science', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ACCENTURE HAS ACQUIRED CORE COMPETE, A CLOUD ANALYTICS SERVICES FIRM HEADQUARTERED IN DURHAM, NORTH CAROLINA.'}{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-04-08 13:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Air Products and New Flyer Tour Cities in Oregon to Demonstrate the Benefits of Hydrogen Fuel Cell Bus Technology', 'text': "LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., APRIL 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) AND NEW FLYER OF AMERICA INC. CONTINUED ITS TOUR OF THE NORTHWEST UNITED STATES (U.S.) AT THE END OF MARCH, VISITING TWO CITIES IN OREGON TO DEMONSTRATE THE BENEFITS OF FUEL CELL ELECTRIC BUSES POWERED WITH AIR PRODUCTS' HYDROGEN."}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2021-04-08 12:43:00-04:56', 'title': 'AWS Announces General Availability of Amazon Lookout for Equipment', 'text': "SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, 