ER TWO ROUTES OF ADMINISTRATION OPTIONS PROVIDING PATIENTS AND PHYSICIANS THE FLEXIBILITY TO CHOOSE THE ONE THAT BEST FITS THEIR INDIVIDUAL NEEDS."}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2021-04-08 03:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'PsiOxus Therapeutics Updates Agreement with Bristol Myers Squibb to Advance their Clinical Stage Immuno-Oncology Collaboration', 'text': 'OXFORD, ENGLAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PSIOXUS THERAPEUTICS, LTD. ANNOUNCES AN UPDATED AGREEMENT TO ADVANCE ITS CLINICAL COLLABORATION WITH BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB.'}{'symbol': 'CDNS', 'date': '2021-04-08 10:46:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cadence Collaborates With Samsung Foundry to Accelerate Hyperscale Computing SoC Design for Process Nodes Down to 4nm', 'text': "SAN JOSE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CADENCE ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS OPTIMIZED THE CADENCE DIGITAL 20.1 FULL FLOW FOR SAMSUNG FOUNDRY'S ADVANCED-PROCESS TECHNOLOGIES DOWN TO 4NM."}{'symbol': 'CDNS', 'date': '2021-04-08 10:45:00-04:56', 'title': 'Cadence Delivers Automotive Reference Flow for Samsung Foundry 14LPU Process Technology', 'text': "SAN JOSE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CADENCE ANNOUNCED THE AVAILABILITY OF AN AUTOMOTIVE-OPTIMIZED CADENCE DIGITAL FULL FLOW FOR SAMSUNG FOUNDRY'S 14LPU PROCESS TECHNOLOGY."}{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-04-08 08:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Caesars Entertainment, Inc. Completes Previously Announced Sale of MontBleu Resort Casino & Spa to Bally's Corporation", 'text': 'RENO, NEV. AND LAS VEGAS, APRIL 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSING OF THE SALE OF MONTBLEU RESORT CASINO & SPA TO BALLY\'S CORPORATION. THE CLOSING SATISFIES CAESARS\' AGREEMENT WITH THE FEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION TO DIVEST THE ASSET IN CONNECTION WITH THE CAESARS-ELDORADO MERGER, WHICH CLOSED IN JULY 2020.'}{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2021-04-08 12:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wanderlust & Work: Super-Charged MedallionNet Redefining Remote Working on Princess Cruises MedallionClass® Ships', 'text': 'SANTA CLARITA, CALI