AR TIME HORIZONS.'}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-04-08 14:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Southern Company first-quarter earnings to be released April 29', 'text': 'ATLANTA, APRIL 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHERN COMPANY PLANS TO RELEASE ITS EARNINGS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021 BY 7:30 A.M. EDT ON THURSDAY, APRIL 29, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-04-08 12:01:00-04:56', 'title': "Southern Company making additional executive moves in advance of Mark Lantrip's planned retirement after 40 years with the organization", 'text': 'ATLANTA, APRIL 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHERN COMPANY TODAY ANNOUNCED ADDITIONAL PERSONNEL MOVES IN ADVANCE OF THE RETIREMENT OF MARK LANTRIP AFTER 40 YEARS OF SERVICE. LANTRIP, WHO WILL BE RETIRING THIS MONTH, MOST RECENTLY SERVED AS THE EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT FOR SOUTHERN COMPANY AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF SOUTHERN COMPANY SERVICES, INC. (SCS), THE SOUTHERN COMPANY SYSTEM SERVICE COMPANY AND A WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF SOUTHERN COMPANY.'}{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2021-04-08 01:01:00-04:56', 'title': "Industry's first DC/DC controllers with an integrated active EMI filter enable engineers to achieve the smallest low-EMI power designs", 'text': 'DALLAS, APRIL 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TEXAS INSTRUMENTS (TI) (NASDAQ: TXN) TODAY INTRODUCED A NEW FAMILY OF SYNCHRONOUS DC/DC BUCK CONTROLLERS THAT ENABLE ENGINEERS TO SHRINK THE SIZE OF THE POWER-SUPPLY SOLUTION AND LOWER ITS ELECTROMAGNETIC INTERFERENCE (EMI). FEATURING AN INTEGRATED ACTIVE EMI FILTER (AEF) AND DUAL-RANDOM SPREAD-SPECTRUM (DRSS) TECHNOLOGY, THE LM25149-Q1 AND LM25149 ENABLE ENGINEERS TO CUT THE AREA OF THE EXTERNAL EMI FILTER IN HALF, LOWER THE CONDUCTED EMI OF THE POWER DESIGN BY AS MUCH AS 55 DBΜV ACROSS MULTIPLE FREQUENCY BANDS, OR ACHIEVE A COMBINATION OF REDUCED FILTER SIZE AND LOW EMI.'}{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2021-04-08 09:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'The Pandemic Didn\'t Just Disrupt Our Homelife, It Changed How We Understand "Home"', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C.,